# Regression game input (tools/regress/hatari/drive.py format): times are
# seconds from the program start. Worked out in Hatari 2.4.1, plain ST,
# TOS 2.06, 4 MB, 22 Nov 2026; "mark play" is where gameplay was on screen.
start D:\DEFENDER\DEFENDER.TOS
seconds 80
shots 4
20 key 0x3B       # F1: one player
25 key 0x3B
30 key 0x3B
32 mark play
35 key 0x3B
40 keydown 0x32   # M thrust
40 keydown 0x26   # L fire
55 keyup 0x26
55 keyup 0x32
60 key 0x39       # Space reverse
62 keydown 0x32
75 keyup 0x32
